// Copy to Config.local.xcconfig and fill in. Config.local.xcconfig is
// gitignored; this file is the committed template and must never hold a real
// value (CLAUDE.md: secrets never in the repo).
//
// SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID
//   From https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard. Development Mode allows one
//   client ID per developer and five users per app (SPEC.md §4.1), which is
//   exactly enough for a single-user sideloaded build.
//
// SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI
//   Must match the redirect URI registered in the dashboard exactly, and its
//   scheme must be registered as a URL type on the iOS companion target.
//   `//` inside an xcconfig value starts a comment, so the slashes are spelled
//   through a variable — this is the standard workaround, not a typo.

SLASH = /

SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID = your_client_id_here
SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI = biorhythm:$(SLASH)$(SLASH)callback
